  "description": "The 365 RACE is an adventurer equipped with durable and high-performance components.\n• SHIMANO take care of shifting and braking. The 365 RACE benefits from the most prestigious version of the GRX 11-speed gravel-specific groupset: the RX810.\n• DT SWISS G 1800 Spline wheels are robust and with rims specific for gravel riding, they are equally reliable with the Swiss brand's 370 hubs. Tubeless compatible.\n• Braking is done with the SHIMANO GRX. Rotors are 180mm front and rear.\n• A KS Lev Si dropper post keeps things smooth. It's the essential tool for enjoying descents safely. The post is activated using the left lever to avoid cluttering the cockpit.",
